[Prototype content]

This is the main document. It has a beginning, a couple of places to wander, and an end.

## A little room for a detour

Some thoughts belong beside the thing you are reading. Open [a margin note](Reading.attach/Margin.doc.card) and this document will make room for it.

The note has its own address. You can follow it, share it, or come back here.

## Keeping your bearings

An aside can carry its context with it. [Why keep the parent?](Reading.attach/Context.doc.card) explores that second idea.

You do not need to read either note to finish this document.

## The end

That is all. Return to [the collection](Menu.doc.card), or revisit either note.
